  "source": [
    "# ViT Model Performance Comparison with CNN Model\n",
    "\n",
    "This section compares the performance of the Vision Transformer (ViT) model with a Convolutional Neural Network (CNN) model on the CIFAR-10 dataset. The comparison focuses on classification accuracy, training performance, and model behavior."
  ]
}
